@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
title State Machine Diagram - Visit / Service Lifecycle v1.1

[*] --> BelumCheckIn : confirmed booking reaches service date
BelumCheckIn --> CheckedIn : admin records patient arrival
BelumCheckIn --> TidakHadir : no-show rule is met
CheckedIn --> MenungguAntrean : check-in data and queue number saved
MenungguAntrean --> SedangDilayani : staff calls patient
SedangDilayani --> SelesaiDilayani : service record completed

TidakHadir --> [*]
SelesaiDilayani --> [*]

note right of BelumCheckIn
  A Visit is associated with a confirmed Booking.
  Visit status tracks attendance and service progress;
  it does not replace the Booking status.
end note

note bottom of SelesaiDilayani
  Invoice/payment processing is separate.
  Payment outcome does not change Visit or Booking status.
end note
@enduml
